{"4950680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DeathSlots", "steam_appid": 4950680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>DeathSlots</strong> , a game about slots, levelling up and collecting stuff, a brand new adventure from<strong> NecroCatic Games</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Awesome <strong>slot</strong> action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Turn based &quot;combat&quot; w/ enemies from theSoulGrinder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collecting monies and spending monies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Gambling!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collectibles and costumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Humor?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many jackpots can you win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4950680/extras/3346400416c80cf4a925965717ee8f12.avif?t=1787804276\" width=1417 height=631 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING</strong>: Game contains flashing lights, gambling and funny witty lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>DeathSlots</strong> , a game about slots, levelling up and collecting stuff, a brand new adventure from<strong> NecroCatic Games</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Awesome <strong>slot</strong> action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Turn based &quot;combat&quot; w/ enemies from theSoulG